Z||000000||Back On Holiday||10-13-2001||08:28 PM||||Well Guys, after finding Glass inside the Front Fascia, and Glass under the Dr. Side Seat, I am inclined to believe that there was an accident in my 86se before I got it, and the windshield was replaced.  I decided to spend $20 on carfax, which was a waste cause it didn't tell me anything, so I ran my dads old Lemon GMC Jimmy that GM bought back after my dad sued GM for Lemon law.  well, guess what... it DIDN'T SHOW as a LEMON!  So, what did GM do?  they took it OUT OF STATE to Virginia (from Pennsylvania) and got rid of it there.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> - Carfax doesn't always show everything,<BR>so don't bother I say!<P>heres the carfax:<BR>   <BR>Dear Carfax customer: <BR>   <BR>Thank you for ordering a Carfax Vehicle History Report ... your best protection against buying a used car with costly hidden problems.<BR>Scroll down to view your Carfax Report.  <BR>    <P><BR>In appreciation for your business, we offer our valued customers additional useful services and auto-related savings opportunities. Here are several special offers provided by Carfax and our selected partners to further assist you in the car buying process.<P>     <BR> <BR>Carfax Auto Coupon Locator  <BR>Free Auto Service Coupon for Carfax Customers.<BR>Click Here for a valuable Free Auto Service Coupon from a dealer in your area.<BR>(Availability may vary by area.)<P> <BR>   <P><BR>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------<P>Thanks for using Carfax!<BR>Carfax has screened and selected for you the very best providers who offer quality products and service at low prices. Shop these providers with confidence thanks to Carfax.<P> <BR>Warranties Insurance Finance <BR>     <BR>  <BR> <P> <BR> <BR> GOOD NEWS! Carfax search results confirm this 1996 GMC Truck Jimmy T15 (1GKDT13W2T2518364) qualifies for the $5,000 Carfax Clean Title History Guarantee. By ordering this Carfax Report, you hav